<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Credit Acceptance cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Credit Acceptance cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co downgraded Credit Acceptance Corp to underperform from market perform, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- reduced the earnings estimate to $1.04 per share from $1.17 for 1997, and to $1.20 from $1.45 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares dropped 3-3/8 to 11-3/8.</p>
</text>
